	<#f4cf72>SIXSEVEN</>
	<#aab8c7>Moves & Controls</>

<#72c8eb>BUTTONS</>
Light Punch		^X
Medium Punch		^Y
Heavy Punch		^Z
Light Kick		^A
Medium Kick		^B
Heavy Kick		^C
<#aab8c7>Directions are relative to your opponent.</>
<#aab8c7>A plus sign means simultaneous input.</>

<#72c8eb>MOVEMENT & DEFENSE</>
Super Jump		_D_U
Dash		_F_F
Hop Backward		_B_B
Parry High		_F
Parry Low		_D
Parry Air		_F (Air)
Recovery		^X_+^Y_+^Z

<#72c8eb>THROWS & UNIQUE ATTACKS</>
Throw (Forward)		_F_+^X_+^A
Throw (Backward)		_B_+^X_+^A
Inazuma Kick		_F_+^B
Inazuma Kakato Wari		_F_+^Y
Kasumi Geri		_F_+^B
Senpuu Kyaku		_F_+^A
Upper		_F_D_DF_+^X

<#72c8eb>EX MOVES — HOW TO USE</>
<#aab8c7>EX moves are powered-up versions of certain specials.</>
<#aab8c7>Use the normal motion, then press two buttons together.</>
Two Punch buttons		[^X_+^Y/^Y_+^Z/^X_+^Z]
Two Kick buttons		[^A_+^B/^B_+^C/^A_+^C]
<#aab8c7>Use the button type required by that move.</>
<#aab8c7>EX moves spend power; build meter before using them.</>
<#aab8c7>EX specials require 400 power.</>

<#72c8eb>SPECIAL MOVES</>
Hadouken		_D_DF_F_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
Shoryuken		_F_D_DF_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
Tatsumaki Senpukkyaku		_D_DB_B_+[^A/^B/^C]
Air Tatsumaki Senpukkyaku		_D_DB_B_+[^A/^B/^C] (Air)
Ryusenkyaku		_F_DF_D_DB_B_+[^A/^B/^C]
Zenpou Tenshin		_F_DF_D_DB_B_+[^X/^Y/^Z]

<#72c8eb>EX MOVES</>
EX Hadouken		_D_DF_F_+[^X_+^Y/^Y_+^Z/^X_+^Z]
EX Shoryuken		_F_D_DF_+[^X_+^Y/^Y_+^Z/^X_+^Z]
EX Tatsumaki Senpukkyaku		_D_DB_B_+[^A_+^B/^B_+^C/^A_+^C]

<#72c8eb>SUPER ARTS — 1000 POWER</>
Shoryu Reppa		_D_DF_F_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
Shinryuuken		_D_DF_F_+[^A/^B/^C]
Shippu Jinrai Kyaku		_D_DB_B_+[^A/^B/^C]
